OL,3,GNEWSA'Large number' of plaques stolen
OL,4,Afrom crematorium
OL,5,
OL,6,FBosses at a crematorium in
OL,7,FLeicestershire say they are "deeply
OL,8,Fsaddened" after a large number of
OL,9,Fmemorial plaques were stolen from its
OL,10,Fgrounds.
OL,12,FLoughborough Crematorium said thieves
OL,13,Ftargeted an area of its memorial
OL,14,Fgrounds, close to the entrance to the
OL,15,Fsite.
OL,17,FThe crematorium is currently carrying
OL,18,Fout a full audit to identify all
OL,19,Fplaques that are missing and will be
OL,20,Ftrying to contact the families of those
OL,21,Faffected.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
